{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through levels of enemies in a arcade top down shooter arena, evade enemies as they try to take you out.\u00a0 Are you able to clear all the levels and complete them all on the hardest difficulty or want a more casual experience instead.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933640/extras/3f20cad9011cf68c979b9977b7446085.poster.avif?t=1755269750\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933640/extras/3f20cad9011cf68c979b9977b7446085.webm?t=1755269750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933640/extras/3f20cad9011cf68c979b9977b7446085.mp4?t=1755269750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<u>Included in this <strong>Demo</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 - Levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Enemy types with their own unique abilities\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize options for the player character\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Fast pace gameplay with enemies appearing everywhere\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the difficulty for either a casual experience or a challenging one\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933640/extras/1f693925f964faa0dd17adb2b2b3a84a.poster.avif?t=1755269750\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933640/extras/1f693925f964faa0dd17adb2b2b3a84a.webm?t=1755269750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><